      "cooked": "<p>This came up in one of the Sentinels servers and I was curious. Vote based on vibes, doesn’t matter if you love them for lore or mechanics reasons, and you can pick up to three!</p>\n<p>Added Young Legacy on a request, even though we haven’t seen a deck, we do have a nemesis symbol, so I figured it was okay.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://strawpoll.com/polls/05ZdW3aX8g6\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/e/e7c663718ac74712bd4ab7ab69ac2e500f423de7.png\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://strawpoll.com/polls/05ZdW3aX8g6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">StrawPoll</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/362;\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/bdb204980fffe60469182970c02dbb3e24ade189_2_690x362.png\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"690\" height=\"362\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/bdb204980fffe60469182970c02dbb3e24ade189_2_690x362.png, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/bdb204980fffe60469182970c02dbb3e24ade189_2_1035x543.png 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/b/bdb204980fffe60469182970c02dbb3e24ade189.png 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/bdb204980fffe60469182970c02dbb3e24ade189_2_10x10.png\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://strawpoll.com/polls/05ZdW3aX8g6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Favorite Sentinels Hero (Multiverse Era) - Online Poll - StrawPoll.com</a></h3>\n\n  <p>What's your opinion? Vote now: Absolute Zero, Alpha, Akash'Thriya, Argent Adept, Benchmark, Bunker, Captain Cosmic, Chrono-Ranger, Doctor Medico, Expatriette, Darkstrife and Painsta...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
