      "created_at": "2023-06-17T23:44:21.910Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I mean, Mainstay <strong>was</strong> my second choice, but Mister Fixer was right there next to him…</p>\n<p>Probably would have voted for Fashion if she’d been on the list.</p>\n<p>Have I mentioned how much it galls me that Guise is the closest thing to a stretchy hero Sentinels has?  The stretchy ones always get my vote - unless they’re named Reed Richards, that joyless jerk.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
